date-released: "2026-11-12"
abstract: "Describe a place in plain words and this app builds it as a live
  binaural 3D audio scene on your headphones. A Gemma model plans the
  scene, a deterministic Dart compiler grounds it against the prompt,
  ElevenLabs generates each sound, and a real-time Rust mixer renders
  every source through synthetic HRTF convolution while Android head
  tracking keeps the world anchored as you turn."
keywords:
  - binaural audio
  - HRTF
  - spatial audio
  - head tracking
  - Flutter
